    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in one of the most successful and centrally located developments in Wexford Town, this four bedroom semi detached property presents an excellent opportunity to purchase a comfortable home that is literally a one minutes walk from the Tesco Super Store and a seven minute walk to the heart of the town centre and all its amenities.The property is on a fantastic site which offers a good level of privacy and it's ready for its new owner to simply move in. This home is a must see for all first time buyers or investors and offers excellent value.\nAccommodation includes ; a cloakroom ; large livingroom; kitchen; seperate diningroom/office and utility room downstairs and four bedrooms (main ensuite) and a bathroom upstairs.\nThe adjoining garage is a great bonus and offers the future option of creating another room subject to the relevant planning permission."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.9m x 1.26m\nWith tiled flooring and coving.\n\nCloakroom - 2.23m x 1.03m\nWith w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nLiving Room - 5.31m x 3.75m\nPrivate and spacious with solid fuel stove and double doors into the dining room / office /2nd living area.\n\nDining Room / Office - 4.22m x 2.93m\nEnjoys access into the kitchen.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 4.6m x 3.27m\nWith waist and eye level storage and tiled flooring and splashbacks.\n\nUtility Room - 2.81m x 1.58m\nWith tiled flooring and shelving and plumbed for a washing machine.Back door to rear garden.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding - 2.93m x 2.26m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.89m x 2.43m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nBedroom 2 Ensuite - 3.46m x 2.82m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nEnsuite - 1.68m x 1.36m\nWith mains shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.56m x 3.3m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nBathroom - 2.36m x 1.7m\nPart tiled walls with bath (with overhead electric shower), w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.48m x 2.49m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nAttached Garage - 4.84m x 2.71m\nFantastic addition for any home.\n\n"
      },
